[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008725803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121477#issuecomment-5008725803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121477","id":5008725803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKosXKw","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T00:15:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T00:15:16Z","body":"For the interests of making reviewing easier, where is the precision loss being crystallised, is it those lerps in `update_camera()`? i.e. are there other down conversions to 32 bit that are making this redundant, or is there a single difference being calculated between these two positions where the 64 bit pays off?\r\n\r\nI recently had the same problem for mesh decimation in 3.x where I needed 64 bit precision, and ended up making a cut down `Vector3_64` (and some other 64 bit types like `Plane_64`). It quickly gets messy trying to separate out the 3 components in terms of readability. I don't know what other reviewers think of this here, even if it's just a nested struct to keep things local, that's always an option to consider (imo).\r\n\r\n(_In the past I've used templated `Vector3` in different engines to reduce code duplication, but that probably isn't a good fit for Godot._)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008725803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5017122324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121477#issuecomment-5017122324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121477","id":5017122324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKws2FA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T19:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T19:42:05Z","body":"> For the interests of making reviewing easier, where is the precision loss being crystallised, is it those lerps in update_camera()? \r\n\r\nThere seem to be several areas where 32-bit precision is limiting in `master`:\r\n\r\n- The lerps when freelook inertia is greater than `0.0`.\r\n- The general movement in slightly diagonal directions (it ends up going in a straight line instead). It's quite similar for games to also exhibit these problems when far away from the origin, and changing the operations to be performed in 64-bit resolves the issue even if the final coordinates are 32-bit (since the arithmetic to add relative motion can be performed more precisely).\r\n- [The similarity check with `is_equal_approx()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121477/changes#diff-e8886999ba597ccfced7c152a9afb9e5e2d6f133bdf1468e2b809e900a70bc65R516-R523), especially when freelook or panning inertia is greater than `0.0`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5017122324/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5040797897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121477#issuecomment-5040797897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121477","id":5040797897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLHR4yQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T01:26:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T01:26:48Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5040797897/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]